{
  "format_version": 1,
  "name": "client_db_info",
  "group": "coordinator",
  "kind": "positive",
  "description": "ClientDBInfo as a bare table: two GRV proxies and two commit proxies (each a request_stream endpoint: GrvProxyInterface::getConsistentReadVersion and CommitProxyInterface::commit; the other endpoints are derived with Endpoint::getAdjustedEndpoint, commit index 1 = GRV (unused), 2 = getKeyServersLocations on both branches). The first proxy of each kind has a secondary (TLS) address. 7.4 slots: (grvProxies, commitProxies, id, forward, history, tenantMode (TenantMode, a table holding mode: u32), encryptKeyProxy (Optional<EncryptKeyProxyInterface>), clusterId, clusterType, metaclusterName). 8.0 drops tenantMode, encryptKeyProxy and metaclusterName and appends nativeCdcEnabled, nativeCdcTagCount, cdcProxies, streamToCDCProxyId, so clusterId is slot 7 on 7.4 (union slots count twice) and slot 6 on 8.0.",
